{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "015ryu_401_2_4_015_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b791e2abfeda8fd53e7c99d328acb2829a0f3023a73874643c3e44bf2b48c571",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_401_2_4_015_01_09_a:2_4_015_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f843f5c63de0fbc374bd76ae08d965535575a6fae0a153e44e0ddf4e1c4d46c1",
      "text": "现在方便吗！刚才给遇到困难的人指路\n之后，收到了好多点心当谢礼呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_401_2_4_015_01_09_a:2_4_015_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a97f9f2ff45a6fea4f592abeb604d1c2f4af3bb6b0602938671d511dbc592e6",
      "text": "我一个人吃不完，打算下次带去\n事务所，你觉得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_401_2_4_015_01_09_a:2_4_015_01_09_a:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf19a7fa1009ad0e351ebf03d8cf81837e77141226ad8a27f04c5ec8ab997cad",
      "text": "太好啦！大家肯定\n也会很高兴的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_401_2_4_015_01_09_a:2_4_015_01_09_a:cmd-000011:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f11061a68a9ae8c560ac853443f373604255b63929c76331184b55d47d9f1c92",
      "text": "非常欢迎。请务必\n带过来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_401_2_4_015_01_09_a:2_4_015_01_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a9343badb1bb058b7988d01334343b6b20b4a6d71dce88b8d6f7937aefe7b2e",
      "text": "太好啦！平时走的那条路在施工，\n绕道之后居然遇到了这样的好运。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_401_2_4_015_01_09_a:2_4_015_01_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47183feec64d8480591344c4d0ea4ef2c16d3bfebc9e5224e8105b65fd9f3942",
      "text": "啊，说到好运，艺术节的时候也是这样吧。\n摔倒把颜料弄洒了虽然是不幸……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_401_2_4_015_01_09_a:2_4_015_01_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cad802cd2424a7ac6091cf7ce3dcfedbbc4d60ca5332ece849632b3e1cd12ed",
      "text": "但正好成了画作的点睛之笔，\n大家也都挺开心的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_401_2_4_015_01_09_a:2_4_015_01_09_a:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c23f1368cc68447aa8ece48ba82867a28d14e4949f6c551f968ac2ced1c57f3",
      "text": "我觉得这是多亏了\n龙先生的人品呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_401_2_4_015_01_09_a:2_4_015_01_09_a:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7594ad5f3f05c525e3e0e1e0e38e2dd9a544294205cbbe74f6127c516581830b",
      "text": "确实不能算不幸，\n而是很幸运呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_401_2_4_015_01_09_a:2_4_015_01_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa0d5524f014af91484196dcf34082a13f99b042858cc19034e2816d9d143d51",
      "text": "哈哈，谢谢！听了真让人高兴啊，\n●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_401_2_4_015_01_09_a:2_4_015_01_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7cfb4a2e88f1d502cc86fb9338993ad0884558d3176931f9d72b653f9de8d12",
      "text": "今后我也会积极乐观地前进的，\n哎，等、等等……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:015ryu_401_2_4_015_01_09_a:2_4_015_01_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ea2be939b480b9799d101499fc8966fa9eef6299c2ed17ecfe4ec2634a10f72",
      "text": "糟了。快没电了……！\n那就下次再聊吧，制作人！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
